    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Classic Albums Live: Supertramp | Breakfast in America |  Sat, Feb 28, 2026, 8:00 pm | Southam Hall"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/39974/websize_(1)__large.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Breakfast in America is the sixth studio album by the British rock band Supertramp, released on 16 March 1979 by A&M Records. It was recorded from May to December 1978 at The Village Recorder in Los Angeles. It spawned three US Billboard Hot 100 hit singles: The Logical Song (No. 6), Goodbye Stranger (No. 15), and Take the Long Way Home (No. 10). In the UK, The Logical Song and the title track were both top 10 hits, the only two the group had in their native country. \n\nAt the 22nd Annual Grammy Awards in 1980, Breakfast in America won two awards..."
